          "title": "You'll want to know: ferveō, fervēre",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ferveō, fervēre — \"to boil, to be hot\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Aqua in ōllā fervēbat. The water was boiling in the pot."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ferveō, fervēre, ferbuī, also an older fervō, fervere. English fervent."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
